  "description": "This oceanfront getaway is a one-stop shop for some seaside fun, with a gorgeous beach, restaurants, and awesome views of Dubai’s epic skyline. Here, you can check out the playful murals and art installations that add a dash of color to the neighborhood, lounge by the beach club, and try watersports like donut riding, flyboarding, or water biking. There's even a waterpark with thrilling slides, a wave simulator, an infinity pool, and more. Pop by this seaside destination on a city tour of Dubai, which includes other iconic attractions like The Dubai Mall, Burj Khalifa, and Jumeirah Mosque.",
